    "title": "Tune Delivery Network (TDN)",
    "description": "The Tune Delivery Network app enables your TDN tuner to send you their tunes for your vehicle. An HP Tuners RTD, MPVI2, or other TDN-compatible delivery device is required.\r\n\r\nPlease note that this app is designed for users who have a relationship with a tuner that is part of the TDN system, and is not intended as a solution for self-tuners or non-TDN tuners.",
